    "detailed_description": "<h1>SHORT GRIM STORIES</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>A short story about a girl who has forgotten her name.<br>But it seems she lost something else along with her name. And she's losing it even now.<br><br>The novella is more an experiment with abstractions than a standard story.<br>Sources of inspiration: novellas about milk and the cartoon &quot;Hedgehog in the Fog&quot;.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A kinetic novel about the defense mechanisms of the psyche<br></li><li>A psychedelic narrative that opens up a wide range of interpretations<br></li><li>Short duration (10-15 minutes)</li></ul>",
